  },
  "usage": [
    "Geometry: one quad for the board (board_c, unlit-ish dark PBR: roughness 0.35 lacquer / 0.8 cedar, metal 0) and one quad 3-8 mm in front of it for the tubes, mapped to board.sign_uv. Double-sided blade signs: two tube quads back to back.",
    "Tube shader (additive or emissive, no lighting): float aa = fwidth(s) ; core_i = smoothstep(0.5 - aa, 0.5 + aa, sdf_i) ; halo_i = glow_i ; rgb = sum_i tube_color_i * (core_i * (1.0 + 1.5 * smoothstep(0.5, 0.62, sdf_i)) + halo_i * 0.35) * emissive_intensity. Linear colour in, let the game's ACES grade + bloom do the rest.",
    "SDF keeps the tube razor sharp at any distance; at long range (or in the low tier) sample only the tube mask (alpha) and glow.",
    "Light the scene with ONE small point/rect light per sign in the tube colour (or bake into the lightmap); reflections come from the emissive quad itself."
